# Store text with LF, as pmtiles-swarm does and as the Ubuntu target expects.
# Without this, files written by a Windows editor land in git as CRLF and a
# later edit from a tool that writes LF shows up as a whole-file diff.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
# Browser libraries copied verbatim from npm: never touched by any line-ending
# rule, so they stay byte-identical to what was published (public/vendor/VENDORED.md)
public/vendor/** -text
